{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "macros.html.j2" as m %}
{% import "paper_macros.html.j2" as pm %}
{% block title %}Runs{% endblock %}
{% block toc %}
{{ m.toc_item("list", "Every meeting", "pm") }}
{{ m.toc_item("read", "How to read a run", "neutral") }}
{% endblock %}
{% block hero %}
<header class="hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">Runs</p>
  <h1>Every council meeting, newest first</h1>
  <p class="lede">The council meets on a fixed schedule. Paper meetings use real data and the real agents but trade nothing; rehearsals ran the live pipeline before a broker account was connected; live meetings will follow. Every meeting is sealed before anyone sees its outcome.</p>
</header>
{% endblock %}

{% macro card(x) %}
<li class="mtg" id="{{ x.anchor }}">
  <p class="mtg-head">
    {% if x.kind == "paper" %}{{ pm.badge() }}{% else %}{{ m.chip(x.mode_chip) }}{% endif %}
    <span class="mtg-when">{{ x.slot | when }}</span>
    {% if x.decision_no %}<span class="mtg-no">Decision #{{ x.decision_no }}</span>{% endif %}
    {% if x.seal == "verified" %}<span class="chip state-executed" title="The published file re-hashes to the commitment sealed before the outcome"><span aria-hidden="true">✓ </span>VERIFIED</span>{% elif x.seal == "sealed" %}<span class="chip state-sealed" title="Sealed before the outcome; not yet re-checked">SEALED</span>{% else %}<span class="chip state-warn"><span aria-hidden="true">! </span>NO SEAL</span>{% endif %}
  </p>
  {% if x.late %}<p class="mtg-late small"><span aria-hidden="true">◷ </span>{{ x.late | cap }}.</p>{% endif %}
  <h3 class="mtg-verdict">{{ x.verdict }}</h3>
  {% if x.has_swing %}
  <p class="mtg-closest">{{ plural(x.ideas, "idea") | cap }} reviewed.{% if x.closest %}{% set c = x.closest %} Closest to trading: <a class="tkr" href="{{ c.href }}">{{ c.ticker | ticker }}</a> {{ pm.side(c.side) }} — stopped at <strong>{{ c.where }}</strong>{% if c.why %} ({{ c.why }}){% endif %}{% if c.votes %}, after the manager voted {{ c.votes }} to enter{% endif %}.{% elif not x.ideas %} The Scout pitched no swing idea.{% endif %}</p>
  {% endif %}
  {% if x.changed %}<p class="mtg-changed"><span class="mtg-k">{{ "What changed" if x.kind == "paper" else "Against the mechanical reference" }}</span> {% for part in x.changed %}<span{% if x.kind == "paper" %} class="nowrap"{% endif %}>{{ part }}</span>{% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}</p>{% endif %}
  <ul class="mtg-facts">
    {% if x.agree %}<li>Manager attempts agreeing <strong class="n">{{ x.agree.text }}</strong></li>{% endif %}
    {% if x.solo is not none %}<li>Solo agent agreed? <strong>{{ "yes" if x.solo else "no" }}</strong></li>{% endif %}
    {% if x.decision %}<li>Decision <a class="mtg-dec" href="{{ x.decision.href }}" title="Open the decision part of this run">{{ m.chip(x.decision.chip) }}</a>{% if x.decision.words %} <span class="muted">{{ x.decision.words }}</span>{% endif %}</li>{% endif %}
  </ul>
  <details class="jd mtg-health accent-pm">
    <summary>{{ m.mark({"css": "ok" if x.health.ok else "fallback", "word": x.health.summary}) }}</summary>
    <div class="jd-body">
    {% if x.health.agents %}
    <ul class="mtg-agents">
      {% for a in x.health.agents %}<li><span class="dot accent-{{ a.accent }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% if a.href %}<a href="{{ a.href }}">{{ a.name }}</a>{% else %}{{ a.name }}{% endif %} <span class="mtg-aw mtg-{{ a.css }}">{{ a.word }}</span> <span class="muted small">{{ plural(a.calls, "call") }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
    {% else %}<p class="small muted">No model call was recorded for this meeting.</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </details>
  <p class="mtg-links">
    {% if x.decision_href %}<a class="mtg-btn" href="{{ x.decision_href }}">Open decision #{{ x.decision_no }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% endif %}
    {% if x.run_href %}<a class="mtg-btn" href="{{ x.run_href }}">Open transcript <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>{% endif %}
  </p>
</li>
{% endmacro %}

{% block main %}
{% call m.section("list", 1, "Every meeting", "pm") %}
{% if meetings %}
{% set n_paper = meetings | selectattr("kind", "equalto", "paper") | list | length %}
{% set n_reh = meetings | selectattr("kind", "equalto", "rehearsal") | list | length %}
{% set n_live = meetings | selectattr("kind", "equalto", "live") | list | length %}
<p class="mtg-count">{% if meetings | length == 1 %}One meeting so far; the next one appears here once it is sealed and published.{% else %}{{ meetings | length }} meetings so far: {% set parts = [] %}{% if n_paper %}{% set _ = parts.append(n_paper ~ " paper") %}{% endif %}{% if n_reh %}{% set _ = parts.append(plural(n_reh, "rehearsal")) %}{% endif %}{% if n_live %}{% set _ = parts.append(n_live ~ " live") %}{% endif %}{{ parts | join(", ") }}.{% endif %}</p>
<ol class="mtg-list" aria-label="Every meeting, newest first">
{% for x in meetings %}{{ card(x) }}{% endfor %}
</ol>
{% if gaps %}
<p class="mtg-gaps small"><span aria-hidden="true">◷ </span><strong>Slots without a meeting:</strong> {% for g in gaps %}{{ g.slot | when }} ({{ g.words }}){% if not loop.last %} · {% endif %}{% endfor %}.</p>
{% endif %}
<p class="small muted">Manager attempts agreeing: of the valid core-manager attempts, how many made the same call, on the line where they agreed least. Solo agent: one agent without analysts or debate, run beside the council as a control; "yes" means it landed on the same core weights. Sizes and moves are shares of the portfolio.</p>
{% else %}
{{ m.empty("No meetings yet", "No meeting has been published. The first one will appear here once it is sealed.") }}
{% endif %}
{% endcall %}

{% call m.section("read", 2, "How to read a run", "neutral") %}
<p>A meeting opens on one of two pages, depending on its kind.</p>
<div class="mtg-flows">
  <div class="mtg-flow">
    <h3>{{ pm.badge() }} Decision page</h3>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><strong>The verdict</strong>: what was entered (or "No trade"), the idea that got closest and where it stopped, the core weights and the swing budget.</li>
      <li><strong>Every idea's journey</strong>: each idea the Scout pitched, through the code gate, the Skeptic, the bull and the bear, the manager and the swing rules; the step where it stopped says why.</li>
      <li><strong>Core council</strong>: the core weights before and after, what the risk engine held and each manager attempt.</li>
      <li><strong>Inputs</strong> and <strong>the book after this decision</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div class="mtg-flow">
    <h3>{{ m.chip({"label": "REHEARSAL", "css": "rehearsal", "title": ""}) }} / {{ m.chip({"label": "LIVE", "css": "executed", "title": ""}) }} Transcript</h3>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><strong>At a glance</strong>: what happened in three sentences and the run step by step; each step opens its agent.</li>
      <li><strong>What changed</strong>: only the lines that moved away from the mechanical reference, and why.</li>
      <li><strong>The agents, in the order they ran</strong>: each one's prompt, what it saw, what it said and what happened to it.</li>
      <li><strong>Decision</strong>, <strong>facts the council saw</strong> and <strong>the seal and every model call</strong>.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
{% endblock %}
